+ * RK3588 description, where the task number is twelve bits:
+ *
+ *   RK3588   BIT[11:0] task_number, BIT[12] pp_en, BIT[13] count_clear
+ *   RK3576   BIT[15:0] task_number, BIT[16] pp_en, BIT[17] count_clear,
+ *            BIT[18] last_layer_clear
