+ * read_cgroup_file() - Read from a cgroup file
+ * @relative_path: The cgroup path, relative to the workdir
+ * @file: The name of the file in cgroupfs to read from
+ * @buf: Buffer to read into, NUL-terminated on success
+ * @len: Size of @buf
